# Files the linter must not scan, because they quote slop on purpose.
# One glob per line, matched against the repo-relative and absolute path.
# These files also carry a `slop-lint: off` marker, in YAML front matter or as
# an HTML comment, so either mechanism alone is enough.

skills/no-ai-slop/*
skills/no-ai-slop/channels/*
skills/no-slop-setup/*
style/*
commands/*
evals/fixtures/*
evals/fixtures/*/*
